<style>
#background-image {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 50% ;
    transform: translateX(-50% );
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100%;/* Ensure the min-height is 115% to cut off the bottom 15% */
    object-fit: fit; /* Ensure the video covers the entire element */
    object-position: top; /* Align the video to the top */
    z-index: -1000;
  }
  
#image-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100% ;
  min-height: 200% ;
  background-color: rgba(226, 242, 255, 0.4); /* Overlay color */
  z-index: -999;
}
	.content {
	min-height: 100vh;
	width: 100vw;
	position: relative;

}
	.header {
	font-family: sans-serif;
	font-weight: 400;
	color: #4A4A4A;
	font-size: 7vmin;
	margin-top: 10%;
	margin-left: 10%;
	width: 80%;
}

.text {
	font-family: sans-serif;
	font-weight: 100;
	color: #4A4A4A;
	text-align: justify;
	width: 80%;
	margin: auto;
	font-size: 3vmin;
	margin-top: 2%;
}

.orange {
	color: #E55F25;
	font-weight: 450;
}

.info-container {
  position: relative;
  width: 90vw;
  padding-top: 2%;
  padding-bottom: 10%;
}

.info5 {
  margin-left: 10%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.info52 {
  margin-left: 10%;
  display: flex;
  display: inline-flex;
  margin-top: 3%;
}

.text5 {
  font-family: sans-serif;
  font-weight: 100;
  font-size: 3vmin;
  color: #4A4A4A;
  padding-left: 1%;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 0;
}

.orange-c, .blue-c {
	display: inline-block;
	margin-right: 1%;
	height: 1em;
	vertical-align: middle;
}
</style>

<%= image_tag 'book-bg.png', id: 'background-image' %>
<div id='image-overlay'></div>

<div class = 'content'>

<p class = 'header'>Policies</p>
<p class = 'text'>Welcome to Wander Sports! We take pride in providing our customers with a safe and enjoyable experience while
out on the water.</p>

<p class = 'text'>To ensure the safety of our customers and the longevity of our equipment, we have established the following policies:</p>
<div class = 'info-container'>
<div class = 'info5'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Safety Policy:</span> The safety of our customers is our top priority. All customers must wear a personal flotation device (PFD) while using our
equipment. In addition, customers must be able to swim and have basic knowledge of paddling techniques. We also reserve the right to deny
rental to anyone who we believe may be under the influence of drugs or alcohol.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class:'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Equipment Damage Policy:</span> Our inflatable stand up paddle boards are high-quality and durable, but they still require proper care to maintain
their condition. We expect our customers to treat our equipment with respect and to avoid any intentional damage. We prohibit the use of our
SUPs in shallow water, near rocks, or in any other areas where the equipment could be damaged. In the event that our equipment is damaged
due to negligence or misuse, the customer will be responsible for repair or replacement costs.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Rental Agreement:</span> Before using our equipment, all customers must sign a rental agreement that outlines our policies and provides important
safety information. This agreement includes a waiver of liability and a statement acknowledging that the customer has read and understands
our policies.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Safety Instruction:</span> We will provide a brief safety instruction video for customers before use of the equipment. This instruction will cover
inflation/deflation of the board, basic paddling techniques, safety rules, and emergency procedures.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Rental Periods:</span> Our rental periods are typically for a half-day or full-day. Customers are responsible for returning the equipment at the end of
the rental period. Late fees may apply for equipment returned after the agreed-upon time.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Reservations:</span> We strongly encourage customers to make reservations in advance to ensure availability. Reservations can be made online or by
phone.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Age Restrictions:</span> Anyone over the age of 18 or a minor accompanied by their respective adult guardian may rent our equipment upon signing a
Release of Liability waiver/Hold Harmless Agreement.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Payment:</span> We accept all Credit Cards, cash, venmo, apple pay or pay online once you book your activity. A credit card pre-authorization hold of
$100 is required and will be released upon the return of the rental equipment in good condition.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Reservation Requirements:</span> All renters must provide a valid form of ID upon pick up for a single rider or just one for a group. Anyone over the
age of 18 or a minor accompanied by their respective adult guardian may rent our equipment.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'orange-carat.svg', class: 'orange-c'%>
<p class = "text5"><span class = 'orange'>Cancellations/Rescheduling/Refunds:</span> Cancellations made 5 days or more before your reserved date are eligible for a full refund, less a 10%
processing fee.<br>Cancellations made between 2 - 5 days from your reserved date will receive a 50% refund. Cancellations made within 48 hours from your
reserved date will receive NO refund, a credit can be provided only if the equipment is rebooked by another party.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'blue-carat.svg', class: 'blue-c'%>
<p class = "text5">NO SHOWS are charged in full for the rental period reserved. Any party that has not arrived by the scheduled time of the rental shall be
deemed a NO SHOW. We are flexible; if you are running late, please just let us know.<br>We reserve the right to cancel your reservation for violations to our policies.</p>
</div>
<div class = 'info52'>
	<%= image_tag 'blue-carat.svg', class: 'blue-c'%>
<p class = 'text5'>We reserve the right, solely at our discretion, to reschedule and/or cancel your reservation in the event of inclement weather. Reservations
cancelled due to weather (or any other VALID and APPROVED reason) during the rental period will be given a voucher for credit toward use of
same or similar piece of equipment at later date or time</p>
</div>
<p class = 'text' style = 'margin-left: 12.7%;'>We know it's a lot, but by following these policies, we can provide a safe and enjoyable experience for our customers while also maintaining the quality of our equipment.  We appreciate your cooperation and look forward to serving you.</p>
</div>
</div>